{"unit_id": "tag:01K0:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个态射（morphism）（在概形（schemes）之间）。设<MATH_0002>是一个点（point）。\n<TEXTITOPEN_0001><MATH_0003>，即<MATH_0004>在<MATH_0005>上的概形论纤维（scheme theoretic fibre）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，简称<TEXTITOPEN_0002><MATH_0006>在<MATH_0007>上的纤维（fibre）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，是与下列纤维积（fibre product）图（diagram）相配的概形（scheme）：\n<MATH_0008>\n我们总把纤维（fibre）<MATH_0009>视为<MATH_0010>上的概形（scheme）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "scheme theoretic fibre", "target_term": "概形论纤维"}, {"source_term": "fibre", "target_term": "纤维"}, {"source_term": "fibre product", "target_term": "纤维积"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "fibre", "target_term": "纤维"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指概形范畴中的态射"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指所讨论的概形"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点", "context": "指概形中的点"}, {"source_term": "scheme theoretic fibre", "target_term": "概形论纤维", "context": "指带有概形结构的纤维"}, {"source_term": "fibre", "target_term": "纤维", "context": "指概形态射在指定点上的纤维"}, {"source_term": "fibre product", "target_term": "纤维积", "context": "指用来定义纤维的积"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图", "context": "指所列图形"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指概形这一对象"}, {"source_term": "fibre", "target_term": "纤维", "context": "指概形态射在指定点上的纤维"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指概形这一对象"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01K1:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个态射（morphism）（在概形（schemes）之间）。\n考虑下列图（diagrams）：\n<MATHSEG_0001>和<MATHSEG_0002>\n这两个图（diagrams）各自诱导出拓扑空间（topological spaces）的纤维积方块（fibre squares）。特别地，最上方的水平（horizontal）箭头给出到其像（image）的同胚（homeomorphism）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "diagrams", "target_term": "图"}, {"source_term": "diagrams", "target_term": "图"}, {"source_term": "topological spaces", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "fibre squares", "target_term": "纤维积方块"}, {"source_term": "horizontal", "target_term": "水平"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "homeomorphism", "target_term": "同胚"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指概形范畴中的态射"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指所讨论的概形"}, {"source_term": "diagrams", "target_term": "图", "context": "指陈述中所列的两个图"}, {"source_term": "diagrams", "target_term": "图", "context": "指陈述中所列的两个图"}, {"source_term": "topological spaces", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "指图所诱导的方块中的空间"}, {"source_term": "fibre squares", "target_term": "纤维积方块", "context": "指拓扑空间中的纤维积方块"}, {"source_term": "horizontal", "target_term": "水平", "context": "指图中横向的箭头或态射"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像", "context": "指映射所得的像"}, {"source_term": "homeomorphism", "target_term": "同胚", "context": "指箭头到其像给出的同胚"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01K1:proof", "translation": "选取仿射（affine）开集<MATH_0001>，使其包含<MATH_0002>。\n下方的水平（horizontal）态射（morphisms）经由<MATH_0003>分解，例如见引理<REF_0001>。\n因此可以假设<MATH_0004>是仿射（affine）的。若<MATH_0005>也是仿射（affine）的，则由《代数（Algebra）》中的注记<REF_0002>即得结论。\n在一般情形下，对<MATH_0006>作覆盖（covering），所用开集均为仿射（affines）开集即可得出结论。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "horizontal", "target_term": "水平"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "affines", "target_term": "仿射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "指开集或概形具有仿射性"}, {"source_term": "horizontal", "target_term": "水平", "context": "指图中横向的箭头或态射"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指所讨论的态射"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "指开集或概形具有仿射性"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "指开集或概形具有仿射性"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "指被引用的《代数》一章"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "指用仿射开集覆盖给定对象"}, {"source_term": "affines", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "指用于覆盖的仿射开集"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0HA1:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个态射（morphism）（在概形（schemes）之间）。设<MATH_0002>的像（image）为<MATH_0003>。将<MATH_0004>视为<MATH_0005>中的一个点（point）（见引理<REF_0001>），则有\n<MATH_0006>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指概形范畴中的态射"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指所讨论的概形"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像", "context": "指映射所得的像"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点", "context": "指概形中的点"}], "notes": []}
