{"unit_id": "tag:01K2:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n若一个概形（scheme）的底层拓扑空间（topological space）是拟紧（quasi-compact）的，则称它是<TEXTITOPEN_0001>拟紧（quasi-compact）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>的。相应的相对概念定义如下。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指概形这一对象"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "指概形的底层拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "指概形、空间、开集或态射的拟紧性"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "指概形、空间、开集或态射的拟紧性"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01K3:statement", "translation": "若概形（schemes）间的态射（morphism）所对应的底层拓扑空间（topological spaces）之间的映射（map）是拟紧（quasi-compact）的，则称它是<TEXTITOPEN_0001>拟紧（quasi-compact）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>的，见《拓扑学（Topology）》中的定义<REF_0001>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "topological spaces", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑学"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指所讨论的概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指概形范畴中的态射"}, {"source_term": "topological spaces", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "指底层映射的源和目标所用的空间"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指概形态射的底层映射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "指概形、空间、开集或态射的拟紧性"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "指概形、空间、开集或态射的拟紧性"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑学", "context": "指被引用的《拓扑学》一章"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01K4:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是概形（schemes）间的态射（morphism）。\n下列条件等价（equivalent）：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0002>是拟紧（quasi-compact）的，\n<STRUCT_0003> 每个仿射开集（affine open）的逆（inverse）像（image）都是拟紧（quasi-compact）的，\n<STRUCT_0004> 存在一个仿射开集（affine open）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0003>，使得<MATH_0004>对所有<MATH_0005>都是拟紧（quasi-compact）的。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "inverse", "target_term": "逆"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指所讨论的概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指概形范畴中的态射"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "指所列条件彼此等价"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "指概形、空间、开集或态射的拟紧性"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "指具有仿射性的开集"}, {"source_term": "inverse", "target_term": "逆", "context": "与后面的像组成术语逆像"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像", "context": "在本处与逆组成逆像"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "指概形、空间、开集或态射的拟紧性"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "指具有仿射性的开集"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "指由开集组成的覆盖"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "指概形、空间、开集或态射的拟紧性"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01K4:proof", "translation": "设已给定（3）中的覆盖（covering）<MATH_0001>。\n首先，设<MATH_0002>是任意仿射开集（affine open）。对任意<MATH_0003>，可找到一个指标（index）<MATH_0004>，使得<MATH_0005>。\n由于标准开集（standard opens）构成<MATH_0006>上拓扑（topology）的一个基（basis），可找到<MATH_0007>，它是<MATH_0008>中的标准开集（standard open）。\n由紧性（compactness），可找到有限多个（finitely many）点（points）<MATH_0009>，使得<MATH_0010>。对每个<MATH_0011>，将<MATH_0012>写成仿射开集（affine opens）的有限（finite）并（union）。由于<MATH_0013>是标准开集（standard open），<MATH_0014>是<MATH_0015>的标准开集（standard open），见《代数（Algebra）》中的引理<REF_0001>。\n因此<MATH_0016>是仿射（affine）的，从而<MATH_0017>是仿射（affines）开集的有限（finite）并（union）。这就证明了任意仿射开集（affine open）的逆（inverse）像（image）都是仿射开集（affine opens）的有限（finite）并（union）。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n其次，假设每个仿射开集（affine open）的逆（inverse）像（image）都是仿射开集（affine opens）的有限（finite）并（union）。\n设<MATH_0018>是任意拟紧开集（quasi-compact open）。由于<MATH_0019>的拓扑（topology）有一个由仿射开集（affine opens）组成的基（basis），可知<MATH_0020>是仿射开集（affine opens）的有限（finite）并（union）。于是<MATH_0021>的逆（inverse）像（image）是仿射开集（affine opens）的有限（finite）并（union）。因此<MATH_0022>是拟紧（quasi-compact）的。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n最后，假设<MATH_0023>是拟紧（quasi-compact）的。在这种情形下，前一段的论证表明，任意仿射（affine）开集的逆（inverse）像（image）都是仿射开集（affine opens）的有限（finite）并（union）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "index", "target_term": "指标"}, {"source_term": "standard opens", "target_term": "标准开集"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "basis", "target_term": "基"}, {"source_term": "standard open", "target_term": "标准开集"}, {"source_term": "compactness", "target_term": "紧性"}, {"source_term": "finitely many", "target_term": "有限多个"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "union", "target_term": "并"}, {"source_term": "standard open", "target_term": "标准开集"}, {"