{"unit_id": "tag:01K9:proof", "translation": "由《拓扑学（Topology）》中的引理<REF_0001>可知，若<MATH_0001>是闭（closed）的，则特化（specializations）可沿<MATH_0002>提升（lift）。\n反过来，假设特化（specializations）可沿<MATH_0003>提升（lift）。设<MATH_0004>是一个闭子集（closed subset）。可以将<MATH_0005>视为带有约化（reduced）诱导（induced）概形（scheme）结构（structure）的概形（scheme），见定义<REF_0002>。\n由于<MATH_0006>是闭（closed）的，<MATH_0007>在<MATH_0008>上的限制（restriction）仍是拟紧（quasi-compact）的。此外，特化（specializations）也可沿<MATH_0009>提升（lift），见《拓扑学（Topology）》中的引理<REF_0003>。\n因此，只须证明<MATH_0010>在特化（specializations）可沿<MATH_0011>提升（lift）时是闭（closed）的。\n特别地，<MATH_0012>在特化下稳定（stable under specializations），见《拓扑学（Topology）》中的引理<REF_0004>。\n因此<MATH_0013>是闭（closed）的，理由见引理<REF_0005>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑学"}, {"source_term": "closed", "target_term": "闭"}, {"source_term": "specializations", "target_term": "特化"}, {"source_term": "lift", "target_term": "提升"}, {"source_term": "specializations", "target_term": "特化"}, {"source_term": "lift", "target_term": "提升"}, {"source_term": "closed subset", "target_term": "闭子集"}, {"source_term": "reduced", "target_term": "约化"}, {"source_term": "induced", "target_term": "诱导"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "structure", "target_term": "结构"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "closed", "target_term": "闭"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "specializations", "target_term": "特化"}, {"source_term": "lift", "target_term": "提升"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑学"}, {"source_term": "specializations", "target_term": "特化"}, {"source_term": "lift", "target_term": "提升"}, {"source_term": "closed", "target_term": "闭"}, {"source_term": "stable under specializations", "target_term": "在特化下稳定"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑学"}, {"source_term": "closed", "target_term": "闭"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term