{"unit_id": "tag:01KA:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n《拓扑学（Topology）》中的第<REF_0001>节讨论了固有（proper）映射（maps）：它们是拓扑空间（topological spaces）之间的闭（closed）映射（maps），且所有纤维（fibres）均为拟紧（quasi-compact）的，也可表述为所有基变换（base changes）均为闭（closed）映射（maps）的映射（maps）。下面给出代数几何（algebraic geometry）中的对应概念。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑学"}, {"source_term": "proper", "target_term": "固有"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "topological spaces", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "closed", "target_term": "闭"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "fibres", "target_term": "纤维"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "base changes", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "closed", "target_term": "闭"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "algebraic geometry", "target_term": "代数几何"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑学", "context": "指被引用的《拓扑学》一章"}, {"source_term": "proper", "target_term": "固有", "context": "指拓扑空间之间的固有映射"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指所讨论的拓扑空间之间的映射"}, {"source_term": "topological spaces", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "指底层映射的源和目标所用的空间"}, {"source_term": "closed", "target_term": "闭", "context": "指给定子集或映射的闭性"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指所讨论的拓扑空间之间的映射"}, {"source_term": "fibres", "target_term": "纤维", "context": "指拓扑空间之间的映射在各点上的纤维"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "指概形、空间、开集或态射的拟紧性"}, {"source_term": "base changes", "target_term": "基变换", "context": "指映射沿基底映射所得的变换"}, {"source_term": "closed", "target_term": "闭", "context": "指给定子集或映射的闭性"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指所讨论的拓扑空间之间的映射"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指所讨论的拓扑空间之间的映射"}, {"source_term": "algebraic geometry", "target_term": "代数几何", "context": "指引入对应概念的学科"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01KB:statement", "translation": "称概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphism）<MATH_0001>是<TEXTITOPEN_0001>普遍闭（universally closed）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>的，如果其每个基变换（base change）<MATH_0002>都是闭（closed）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "universally closed", "target_term": "普遍闭"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "closed", "target_term": "闭"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指所讨论的概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指概形范畴中的态射"}, {"source_term": "universally closed", "target_term": "普遍闭", "context": "指在任意基变换后仍是闭映射"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换", "context": "指概形或态射沿基底态射的变换"}, {"source_term": "closed", "target_term": "闭", "context": "指给定子集或映射的闭性"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01KA:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n事实上，形容词“普遍（universally）”常这样使用。换言之，给定态射（morphisms）的一个性质<MATH_0001>，称“<MATH_0002>普遍（universally）具有性质<MATH_0003>”，当且仅当其每个基变换（base change）<MATH_0004>都具有<MATH_0005>。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n关于普遍闭（universally closed）态射（morphisms）的性质，更详细的讨论见《态射（Morphisms）》中的第<REF_0001>节。本节只讨论普遍闭（universal closed）态射（morphisms）与满足赋值判别准则（valuative criterion）的存在性部分（existence part）的态射（morphisms）之间的关系。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "universally", "target_term": "普遍"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "universally", "target_term": "普遍"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "universally closed", "target_term": "普遍闭"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "universal closed", "target_term": "普遍闭"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "valuative criterion", "target_term": "赋值判别准则"}, {"source_term": "existence part", "target_term": "存在性部分"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "universally", "target_term": "普遍", "context": "修饰基变换后始终成立的性质"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指所讨论的态射"}, {"source_term": "universally", "target_term": "普遍", "context": "修饰基变换后始终成立的性质"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换", "context": "指概形或态射沿基底态射的变换"}, {"source_term": "universally closed", "target_term": "普遍闭", "context": "指在任意基变换后仍是闭映射"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指所讨论的态射"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指被引用的《态射》一章"}, {"source_term": "universal closed", "target_term": "普遍闭", "context": "指在任意基变换后仍是闭映射"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指所讨论的态射"}, {"source_term": "valuative criterion", "target_term": "赋值判别准则", "context": "指通过赋值环检验态射性质的准则"}, {"source_term": "existence part", "target_term": "存在性部分", "context": "指赋值判别准则中的存在性条件"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指所讨论的态射"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01KC:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphism）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 若<MATH_0002>是普遍闭（universally closed）的，则特化（specializations）可沿<MATH_0003>的任意基变换（base change）提升（lift），见《拓扑学（Topology）》中的定义<REF_0001>。\n<STRUCT_0003> 若<MATH_0004>是拟紧（quasi-compact）的，且特化（specializations）可沿<MATH_0005>的任意基变换（base change）提升（lift），则<MATH_0006>是普遍闭（universally closed）的。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "universally closed", "target_term": "普遍闭"}, {"source_term": "specializations", "target_term": "特化"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "lift", "target_term": "提升"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑学"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "specializations", "target_term": "特化"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "lift", "target_term": "提升"}, {"source_term": "universally closed", "target_term": "普遍闭"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指所讨论的概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指概形范畴中的态射"}, {"source_term": "universally closed", "target_term": "普遍闭", "context": "指在任意基变换后仍是闭映射"}, {"source_term": "specializations", "target_term": "特化", "context": "指拓扑空间中点的特化"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换", "context": "指概形或态射沿基底态射的变换"}, {"source_term": "lift", "target_term": "提升", "context": "指把目标空间中的特化提升到源空间"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑学", "context": "指被引用的《拓扑学》一章"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "指概形、空间、开集或态射的拟紧性"}, {"source_term": "specializations", "target_term": "特化", "context": "指拓扑空间中点的特化"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换", "context": "指概形或态射沿基底态射的变换"}, {"source_term": "lift", "target_term": "提升", "context": "指把目标空间中的特化提升到源空间"}, {"source_term": "universally closed", "target_term": "普遍闭", "context": "指在任意基变换后仍是闭映射"}], "notes": []}
